## 1. Company Profile

### Main business

Veeva Systems is a California-based cloud software company specializing in vertical cloud solutions for the life sciences industry (pharmaceuticals, biotech). The company officially joined the S&P 500 Index on May 7, 2026, replacing the acquired Coterra Energy.

The company's products cover the entire life cycle of life science companies:
- **Commercial Cloud**: CRM, content management, data analysis, helping pharmaceutical companies manage sales teams and commercial operations
- **R&D & Quality Cloud**: clinical trial management, regulatory submission, quality management, safety monitoring, etc.
- **Data Cloud**: patient data, prescription data and other reference data services

### Revenue structure (FY2026, as of January 31, 2026)

