R&D and quality clouds have surpassed commercial clouds as a larger revenue source, reflecting the accelerating trend of clinical and regulatory digitization.

### Market position

- Life science CRM market share is about 80%, with an extremely rare monopoly position
- 9 of the world’s top 20 pharmaceutical companies have committed to using Vault CRM (vs. Salesforce only 3)
- The top 20 pharmaceutical companies all adopt its electronic trial master file (eTMF) product
- More than 115 customers have gone online with Vault CRM
- Join the S&P 500 Index in May 2026

